{"4459790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Painworld", "steam_appid": 4459790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Painworld is a hardcore 3D platformer where every jump matters and every mistake can kill you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dangerous world full of anomalies, brutal traps, and bosses waiting to eat fireballs straight to the face.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PRECISION PLATFORMING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459790/extras/dd371b164443c0c6a0118db3747d53aa.poster.avif?t=1784819452\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459790/extras/dd371b164443c0c6a0118db3747d53aa.webm?t=1784819452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459790/extras/dd371b164443c0c6a0118db3747d53aa.mp4?t=1784819452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every jump requires perfect timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miss it — and try again.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEADLY TRAPS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459790/extras/c24f1850ce253c7b27c1264551f0f2d0.poster.avif?t=1784819452\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459790/extras/c24f1850ce253c7b27c1264551f0f2d0.webm?t=1784819452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459790/extras/c24f1850ce253c7b27c1264551f0f2d0.mp4?t=1784819452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Painworld is not friendly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And it definitely doesn't want you alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GRAVITY MECHANICS</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459790/extras/2ba809e0b2b0a94178e53abb04a3dc91.poster.avif?t=1784819452\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459790/extras/2ba809e0b2b0a94178e53abb04a3dc91.webm?t=1784819452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459790/extras/2ba809e0b2b0a94178e53abb04a3dc91.mp4?t=1784819452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run on walls.<br>Flip gravity.<br>Adapt or fall.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BOSS FIGHTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459790/extras/8d2cb0e699af0cbd3aba2d046da510d7.poster.avif?t=1784819452\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459790/extras/8d2cb0e699af0cbd3aba2d046da510d7.webm?t=1784819452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459790/extras/8d2cb0e699af0cbd3aba2d046da510d7.mp4?t=1784819452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five brutal bosses stand between you and the end of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw fireballs straight into their faces.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BEAUTIFUL BUT DEADLY WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459790/extras/8ff5062857b005e17196c7eeb39f01fc.poster.avif?t=1784819452\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459790/extras/8ff5062857b005e17196c7eeb39f01fc.webm?t=1784819452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459790/extras/8ff5062857b005e17196c7eeb39f01fc.mp4?t=1784819452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight unique biomes connected into one seamless world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every location introduces new dangers and mechanics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From the author</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Painworld is my first game, and I put a piece of my soul into it. I hope that each of you will notice this, if you don't get tired of dying every few seconds. I didn't want you to suffer, but you will definitely feel my love.<br><br>And yes, that's how our parents used to get to school, according to them. Remember that.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Painworld is a hardcore 3D platformer where every jump matters and every mistake can kill you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dangerous world full of anomalies, brutal traps, and bosses waiting to eat fireballs straight to the face.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PRECISION PLATFORMING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459790/extras/dd371b164443c0c6a0118db3747d53aa.poster.avif?t=1784819452\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459790/extras/dd371b164443c0c6a0118db3747d53aa.webm?t=1784819452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459790/extras/dd371b164443c0c6a0118db3747d53aa.mp4?t=1784819452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every jump requires perfect timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miss it — and try again.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEADLY TRAPS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459790/extras/c24f1850ce253c7b27c1264551f0f2d0.poster.avif?t=1784819452\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459790/extras/c24f1850ce253c7b27c1264551f0f2d0.webm?t=1784819452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459790/extras/c24f1850ce253c7b27c1264551f0f2d0.mp4?t=1784819452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Painworld is not friendly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And it definitely doesn't want you alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GRAVITY MECHANICS</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459790/extras/2ba809e0b2b0a94178e53abb04a3dc91.poster.avif?t=1784819452\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459790/extras/2ba809e0b2b0a94178e53abb04a3dc91.webm?t=1784819452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459790/extras/2ba809e0b2b0a94178e53abb04a3dc91.mp4?t=1784819452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run on walls.<br>Flip gravity.<br>Adapt or fall.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BOSS FIGHTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459790/extras/8d2cb0e699af0cbd3aba2d046da510d7.poster.avif?t=1784819452\" width=1170 h